  "story": {
    "text": "Mrs. Jennings takes Elinor and Marianne to {LONDON}. Marianne writes to Willoughby again and again, and hears {NOTHING}. At a crowded {PARTY} she sees him at last, and flies to him. He bows {STIFFLY}, speaks to Elinor, and turns back to an {ELEGANT} young lady. Marianne, white as a sheet, {TREMBLES}.",
